---
---

<div class="bg-background-neutral-faint">
  <section
    aria-labelledby="questions-about-pricing"
    class="px-6 py-24 md:py-32"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[840px]">
      <p class="mb-4 text-center font-mono text-[12px] leading-none tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent uppercase">
        FAQ
      </p>
      <h2
        id="questions-about-pricing"
        class="text-center text-[32px] leading-[1.15] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-text-primary md:text-[40px]"
      >
        What you’re{" "}
        <span class="text-gradient-heading">probably wondering.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-4 text-center">
        <ol class="mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-[584px] grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500/25"
            ></span>
            <span class="mt-3 max-w-[140px] text-[12px] leading-[17.4px] font-medium text-text-primary">
              Describe your role
            </span>
            <span class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] leading-[13.5px] lg:text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.17em] text-text-accent uppercase">
              Free
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500/25"
            ></span>
            <span class="mt-3 max-w-[140px] text-[12px] leading-[17.4px] font-medium text-text-primary">
              Approve the role and the terms
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-indigo-500/25"
            ></span>
            <span class="mt-3 max-w-[140px] text-[12px] leading-[17.4px] font-medium text-text-primary">
              The search starts
            </span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 divide-y divide-border-default border-y border-border-default">
        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-text-primary focus-visible:shadow-ring focus-visible:outline-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            Does it cost anything to start?
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-[22px] leading-none font-normal text-text-accent transition-transform duration-200 ease-standard group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none"
            >
              +
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="max-w-[64ch] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">
            No. Telling us what you need and getting the role defined is free,
            and the written role is yours whether you hire through us or not.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-text-primary focus-visible:shadow-ring focus-visible:outline-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            When do I commit?
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-[22px] leading-none font-normal text-text-accent transition-transform duration-200 ease-standard group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none"
            >
              +
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="max-w-[64ch] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">
            When you approve the role and the terms. Until then, nothing is
            binding.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-text-primary focus-visible:shadow-ring focus-visible:outline-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            When do I see the price?
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-[22px] leading-none font-normal text-text-accent transition-transform duration-200 ease-standard group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none"
            >
              +
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="max-w-[64ch] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">
            Before anything starts. The terms are in writing, and nothing moves
            forward until you agree to them.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-5 text-[17px] font-semibold text-text-primary focus-visible:shadow-ring focus-visible:outline-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            Does the rate change if the work changes?
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="text-[22px] leading-none font-normal text-text-accent transition-transform duration-200 ease-standard group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none"
            >
              +
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="max-w-[64ch] pb-6 text-[16px] leading-7 text-text-secondary">
            If the scope changes, we revisit it together and update the terms
            with you.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
